From: trungvanle <trung.le.xk@renesas.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Mar 2025 17:14:20 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Updating the procedure for starting and stopping VSP

VSP maybe unstable on some RZ/G3E boards that cause hang board.
It's necessary to de-assert reset signals after enable clocks
in starting and assert reset signals before disable clocks in
stopping VSP to prevent this issue.

Signed-off-by: trungvanle <trung.le.xk@renesas.com>
